      "section_heading": "ATTACHED UNITS AFTER THEIR BODYGUARD UNIT IS DESTROYED",
      "section_id": "19.01.01",
      "semantic_execution_status": "executable_engine_runtime",
      "source_id": "gw-11e-core-rules:attached-units:bodyguard-unit-destroyed",
      "source_text": "ATTACHED UNITS AFTER THEIR BODYGUARD UNIT IS DESTROYED\nSome units have rules stating that when the bodyguard unit in an attached unit is destroyed, leader/support units that were attached to them become separate units with their original starting strengths. When the bodyguard unit in an attached unit affected by such a rule is destroyed, all of those leader/support units remain a single unit for all rules purposes.",
      "transcription_sha256": "cb8ea6a1b9633420c8a2c59989edf8bfd97987ce1847faca6820f08b99931bbe"
    }
